  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"PNkSg\" id=\"PNkSg\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4021bc89\" id=\"u4021bc89\">环境搭建</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u6b610582\" id=\"u6b610582\"><span data-lake-id=\"u66c3f527\" id=\"u66c3f527\">安装rk356x提供好的docker镜像,在该镜像中已经安装好了所需要的环境, 我们使用这个环境主要是将模型转换成rknn格式</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua74ee9f8\" id=\"ua74ee9f8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5b0d3158\" id=\"u5b0d3158\">参考链接：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubd940f04\" id=\"ubd940f04\"><a href=\"https://github.com/airockchip/yolov5.git\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u9ce1c9b3\" id=\"u9ce1c9b3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9ab7c909\" id=\"u9ab7c909\">https://github.com/airockchip/yolov5.git</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3274b5e2\" id=\"u3274b5e2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/rockchip-linux/rknpu2\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u880c4131\" id=\"u880c4131\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubfe074e6\" id=\"ubfe074e6\">https://github.com/rockchip-linux/rknpu2</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua8a39aef\" id=\"ua8a39aef\"><a href=\"https://github.com/rockchip-linux/rknn-toolkit2\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u3f90a693\" id=\"u3f90a693\"><span data-lake-id=\"u18ae1f05\" id=\"u18ae1f05\">https://github.com/rockchip-linux/rknn-toolkit2</span></a></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"jnDc5\" id=\"jnDc5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7105b960\" id=\"u7105b960\">加载docker</span></h3><ol list=\"u939af94f\"><li fid=\"u43105155\" data-lake-id=\"ua350ea07\" id=\"ua350ea07\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucee061a3\" id=\"ucee061a3\">进到环境目录</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22rknn-toolkit2-1.x.x%2Fdocker%2Fdocker_full%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22inden