" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22docker%20run%20-it%20--shm-size%204G%20-v%20D%3A%5C%5CDATA%5C%5Cml%5C%5Crknn-toolkit2-1.5.0%5C%5Cexamples%5C%5Connx%5C%5Cyolov5%3A%2Frknn_yolov5_demo%20rknn-toolkit2%3A1.5.0-ml%20%2Fbin%2Fbash%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LnQZb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7495254c\" id=\"u7495254c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u75f07a97\" id=\"u75f07a97\">其中&quot;-v  主机目录:虚拟机目录&quot; 是将本机目录映射到docker中的目录, 成功进到docker目录之后, 我们就可以来生成模型了</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u736d739d\" id=\"u736d739d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b945510\" id=\"u9b945510\">​</span><br></p><ol list=\"u2af32354\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"ubd96de6c\" data-lake-id=\"ufdce8f7b\" id=\"ufdce8f7b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7b12f96e\" id=\"u7b12f96e\">以后每次启动的时候，启动对应的容器</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22docker%20container%20ls%5Cndocker%20start%20-ai%20%3Ccontainer_name%3E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f7kya%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u536ba56d\" id=\"u536ba56d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1f61c671\" id=\"u1f61c671\">可以使用如下命令查看内存使用</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22df%20-h%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dr348%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"Etipi\" id=\"Etipi\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueeff1157\" id=\"ueeff1157\">模型导出</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ub2672ed6\" id=\"ub2672ed6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub8bf9497\" id=\"ub8bf9497\">在docker容器中进入到rknn_yolov5_demo文件夹,也就是上面映射的文件夹</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22cd%20%2Frknn_yolov5_demo%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HJfbc%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u17c29a88\" id=\"u17c29a88\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf78bad5a\" id=\"uf78bad5a\">执行示例代码:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python3%20.%2Ftest.py%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22thBRJ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u42344d52\" id=\"u42344d52\"><span data-lake-id=\"u301cb08e\" id=\"u301cb08e\">它会自动将onnx格式的模型转换成rknn格式的模型</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22yolov5s-640-640.rknn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BcW0e%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"l7D2w\" id=\"l7D2w\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaa7a5ca5\" id=\"uaa7a5ca5\">yolov5模型训练</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u8cd3b23b\" id=\"u8cd3b23b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u28585782\" id=\"u28585782\">启动训练</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python3%20train.py%20--data%20data%2Flines%2Fitheima_lines.yaml%20--weights%20yolov5s.pt%20%20--img%20640%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lhoNn%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7d7fe881\" id=\"u7d7fe881\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue18a9b10\" id=\"ue18a9b10\">模型导出为onnx</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python%20export.py%20--weights%20yolov5s.pt%20--include%20onnx%20--rknpu%20rk3566%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse